# Line endings, pinned rather than left to each machine's core.autocrlf.
#
# Everything this project writes is LF today, including the PowerShell wrappers
# (Test-Path/robocopy do not care).  cmd files are the exception: cmd.exe parses
# a CRLF batch file and misreads a lone LF, which TEST.md records as a trap, so
# a .bat that lands here later arrives with the ending it needs.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.qgz binary
